# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages header config.
# Required for interactive Python input() to work: SharedArrayBuffer (and
# the Atomics.wait blocking-read trick it enables) is only available in
# browsers when the page is "cross-origin isolated" — these two headers.
# GitHub Pages cannot set custom headers, so this feature won't work there;
# Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, and Vercel (see vercel.json) all support it.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
